<h2>Asobi Review 1.0 (build 923)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Check for Updates sees a release the moment it is out</b> — for real this time. The fresh-fetch fix in 915 was never applied (the updater let go of it before the first check), so a check made within five minutes of a release still said "up to date". Fixed.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
